      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.mapsof.net/reno-beach"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "During heavy rain, water from the levee system funnels into lagoons that feed the town’s pumping stations.",
